abstract: >-
  Analysis code reproducing every number, table and figure in a study of culture-proven neonatal
  infection, total bilirubin and an erythrocyte signature of iron-restricted erythropoiesis. The
  code covers two neonatal clinical cohorts (MIMIC-IV v1.0 and MIMIC-III v1.4) and human hepatocyte
  transcriptomes from GEO, including the phototherapy mediation decomposition reported in the
  current manuscript. Mendelian randomisation and colocalisation scripts from an earlier version of
  the work are retained in the repository for audit but are not reported in this manuscript. MIMIC
  data are access-controlled and are not redistributed; the clinical scripts require a local
  PostgreSQL instance holding the MIMIC schemas.
